# remember:
# - earlier 'use='s override later ones
# - compiled entries don't store cleared caps, so fragments
#   that should clear caps won't by themselves
#   (is this really true?)

# TODO: vim uses libvterm, author of libvterm also made pangoterm with it.
# is vim :terminal closer to pangoterm than xterm?
vim|vim :terminal,
	use=xterm,
vim-color|vim :terminal with 16 colors,
	use=xterm-color,
vim-256color|vim :terminal with 256 colors,
	use=xterm-256color,
